   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Iteration v1: the welcome and the bag, phone first (390 px), then a Full HD PC (1920 px).\nLayout only, no colors: the style comes in the mock-up (step 3). Gray box crossed = a Steam cover;\nfilled arrow = the friend’s vote; dashed arrow = locked (one’s own game counts as an upvote).",
   "originalText": "Iteration v1: the welcome and the bag, phone first (390 px), then a Full HD PC (1920 px).\nLayout only, no colors: the style comes in the mock-up (step 3). Gray box crossed = a Steam cover;\nfilled arrow = the friend’s vote; dashed arrow = locked (one’s own game counts as an upvote).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
